{"id": "EUVD-2026-90646", "enisaUuid": "00059cba-8b9e-3fd8-9544-5a8ee1cc867f", "description": "n8n versions before 1.123.80, from 2.0.0 before 2.39.6, and from 2.40.0 before 2.40.1 contain an authorization bypass vulnerability in the credential test endpoint that resolves project-scoped variables without validating caller access. Attackers can specify an arbitrary project ID in the request body to interpolate sensitive variables into credential test requests sent to attacker-controlled hosts for exfiltration.", "datePublished": "2026-10-01T10:41:57", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-01T13:27:33", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/security/advisories/GHSA-7gvh-q9w3-wqqx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/n8n-before-1.123.80-2.39.6-and-2.40.1-information-disclosure-via-credential-test-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-r56q-6p4g-65g7", "CVE-2026-103252"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "83ff95b0-4134-3c3c-aa66-81e65ab95eb6", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.40.0 <2.40.1"}, {"id": "8f7c6708-070b-3f88-879c-41a5edeffca5", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.39.6"}, {"id": "d5929b8c-7d3b-376c-a8f4-cb963fce3c93", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.123.80"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a431d04f-55fe-322b-95d0-5c60dc4b8d1f", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}], "isExploited": false}